{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21799","headline":"有鸟二十章 十三 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟谓白鹇，雪毛皓白红觜殷。\n贵人妾妇爱光彩，行提坐臂怡朱颜。\n妖姬谢宠辞金屋，雕笼又伴新人宿。\n无心爲主拟衔花，空长白毛映红肉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}